{"id":"n55231-5-8","stage":5,"title":"맥 · 脉搏","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55231-5-8-1","ko":"여기 응급 환자가 들어 왔어요.","zh":"这里来了一名急症患者。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"응급","meaning":"应急，紧急，急诊","explanation":"응급：应急，紧急，急诊。","readings":[{"term":"응급","audio":"/audio/6bd641d8c50387d91cc7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71957","senseId":"1","lemma":"응급","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응급","audio":"/audio/6bd641d8c50387d91cc7.mp3"}},{"text":"환자가","meaning":"患者，病人","explanation":"환자：患者，病人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"환자","audio":"/audio/7780fb9b6e0ea5fdf5fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31669","senseId":"1","lemma":"환자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"환자가","audio":"/audio/40687ec77605438449de.mp3"}},{"text":"들어","meaning":"进去，进入","explanation":"들다：进去，进入；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"1","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어","audio":"/audio/079c88dfcd6e6363232f.mp3"}},{"text":"왔어요.","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔어요","audio":"/audio/2ef5daa5f516291289bc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"6bd641d8c50387d9","term":"응급